msgid ""
"# Gesture Navigation\n"
"\n"
"XCSoar supports touch gestures on the map:\n"
"\n"
"- ![U](resource:IDB_GESTURE_UP) **Swipe Up** (U): Zoom in\n"
"- ![D](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DOWN) **Swipe Down** (D): Zoom out\n"
"- ![R](resource:IDB_GESTURE_RIGHT) **Swipe Right** (R): Previous screen mode\n"
"- ![L](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LEFT) **Swipe Left** (L): Next screen mode\n"
"- ![UD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_UD) **Up-Down** (UD): Auto zoom\n"
"- ![DU](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DU) **Down-Up** (DU): Menu\n"
"- ![DR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DR) **Down-Right** (DR): Waypoint details\n"
"- ![DL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DL) **Down-Left** (DL): Alternates\n"
"- ![LU](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LU) **Left-Up** (LU): Recently used waypoints\n"
"- ![RD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_RD) **Right-Down** (RD): Task manager\n"
"- ![URD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_URD) **Up-Right-Down** (URD): Analysis\n"
"- ![LDR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LDR) **Left-Down-Right** (LDR): Checklist\n"
"- ![URDL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_URDL) **Up-Right-Down-Left** (URDL): Pan mode\n"
"- ![LDRDL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LDRDL) **Left-Down-Right-Down-Left** (LDRDL): Status\n"
"- ![ULDR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_ULDR) **Up-Left-Down-Right** (ULDR): Quick menu\n"
"\n"
"Long-press on the map to enter Pan mode. Tap while in Pan mode to see nearby waypoints."
msgstr ""
"# Navigazione con gesti\n"
"\n"
"XCSoar supporta gesti touch sulla mappa:\n"
"\n"
"- ![U](resource:IDB_GESTURE_UP) **Scorri su** (U): Zoom avanti\n"
"- ![D](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DOWN) **Scorri giù** (D): Zoom indietro\n"
"- ![R](resource:IDB_GESTURE_RIGHT) **Scorri a destra** (R): Modalità schermo precedente\n"
"- ![L](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LEFT) **Scorri a sinistra** (L): Modalità schermo successiva\n"
"- ![UD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_UD) **Su-Giù** (UD): Zoom automatico\n"
"- ![DU](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DU) **Giù-Su** (DU): Menu\n"
"- ![DR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DR) **Giù-Destra** (DR): Dettagli waypoint\n"
"- ![DL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DL) **Giù-Sinistra** (DL): Alternati\n"
"- ![LU](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LU) **Sinistra-Su** (LU): Waypoint usati di recente\n"
"- ![RD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_RD) **Destra-Giù** (RD): Gestore task\n"
"- ![URD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_URD) **Su-Destra-Giù** (URD): Analisi\n"
"- ![LDR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LDR) **Sinistra-Giù-Destra** (LDR): Checklist\n"
"- ![URDL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_URDL) **Su-Destra-Giù-Sinistra** (URDL): Modalità Pan\n"
"- ![LDRDL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LDRDL) **Sinistra-Giù-Destra-Giù-Sinistra** (LDRDL): Stato\n"
"- ![ULDR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_ULDR) **Su-Sinistra-Giù-Destra** (ULDR): Menu rapido\n"
"\n"
"Tieni premuto sulla mappa per entrare in modalità Pan. Tocca in modalità Pan per vedere i waypoint vicini."

msgid "Please enter four letters or digits only (ICAO station code)."
msgstr "Inserisci solo quattro lettere o cifre (codice stazione ICAO)."

msgid "Updating repository"
msgstr "Aggiornamento repository"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Signed countdown until the start gate opens or closes (now). Value colour and secondary line reflect gate state at the current time: Waiting (blue), Open (green), Closed (red). PEV window overrides task gate when set."
msgstr ""
"Conto alla rovescia con segno fino all'apertura o chiusura della start gate "
"(ora). Il colore del valore e la riga secondaria riflettono lo stato della "
"gate all'ora corrente: In attesa (blu), Aperta (verde), Chiusa (rosso). La "
"finestra PEV ha priorità sulla gate del task se impostata."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Same gate as Start open. Main value is estimated time to reach the start line (MacCready leg when available, else distance / ground speed). Value colour and secondary line reflect gate state at that ETA: Too early (blue), Can start (green), Too late (red)."
msgstr ""
"Stessa gate di Start open. Il valore principale è il tempo stimato per "
"raggiungere la linea di partenza (gamba MacCready se disponibile, altrimenti"
" distanza / velocità suolo). Il colore del valore e la riga secondaria "
"riflettono lo stato della gate a quell'ETA: Troppo presto (blu), Può partire"
" (verde), Troppo tardi (rosso)."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Home waypoint name, arrival altitude difference relative to the safety arrival height, and distance. Click to change the home waypoint."
msgstr ""
"Nome del waypoint Home, differenza di altitudine di arrivo rispetto "
"all'altezza di arrivo di sicurezza e distanza. Tocca per cambiare il "
"waypoint Home."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Logger pressure altitude when the device provides it (igc_pressure_altitude), otherwise ISA pressure altitude only (1013.25 hPa; not QNH-corrected). Does not show barometric AMSL or GPS height — use other InfoBoxes for navigation."
msgstr ""
"Altitudine di pressione del logger quando il dispositivo la fornisce "
"(igc_pressure_altitude), altrimenti solo altitudine di pressione ISA "
"(1013,25 hPa; non corretta QNH). Non mostra AMSL barometrico né altezza GPS "
"— usa altre InfoBox per la navigazione."

